WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.280
- Okay, so after three kids,

00:00:02.280 --> 00:00:03.780
are your friends coming to
you for a lot of advice?

00:00:03.780 --> 00:00:05.880
'Cause I've actually had a
couple people on this couch

00:00:05.880 --> 00:00:07.470
say that they come to you for advice.

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:08.303
Like, you're like-
- Oh-

00:00:08.303 --> 00:00:09.539
- [Kelly] A super mom.

00:00:09.539 --> 00:00:10.372
- That's too kind.
- Like Mandy's one of them.

00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:11.205
Mandy Moore was just here, yeah.

00:00:11.205 --> 00:00:12.270
- Mandy is the best.

00:00:12.270 --> 00:00:14.490
She's also a super mom, so you know what?

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:16.710
I think just because I've
been doing this for 10 years,

00:00:16.710 --> 00:00:20.280
and a lotta my friends
just had babies this year,

00:00:20.280 --> 00:00:23.550
so I was obviously so excited for them.

00:00:23.550 --> 00:00:27.270
And then you don't want to
take anyone's experience away.

00:00:27.270 --> 00:00:28.103
You know, like everyone-

00:00:28.103 --> 00:00:29.400
- Yeah, different.
- Goes through it differently.

00:00:29.400 --> 00:00:31.350
I never wanted to be
like Mommy Know It All,

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:33.630
but, of course, I love talking about kids.

00:00:33.630 --> 00:00:37.470
And so, I think the biggest
advice I would always give

00:00:37.470 --> 00:00:38.310
would just be like,

00:00:38.310 --> 00:00:40.140
don't get fooled by the first two weeks,

00:00:40.140 --> 00:00:41.760
'cause you have like an angel baby,

00:00:41.760 --> 00:00:43.560
and they're just, they
haven't woken up yet.

00:00:43.560 --> 00:00:44.393
- Uh-huh.
(audience laughs)

00:00:44.393 --> 00:00:45.226
Do you have those friends who are like,

00:00:45.226 --> 00:00:46.644
"This baby is sleeping through the night"?

00:00:46.644 --> 00:00:47.790
(audience laughs)
Oh my God, it's already."

00:00:47.790 --> 00:00:49.110
And I'm like, "They don't know

00:00:49.110 --> 00:00:50.220
that they've entered the world yet."

00:00:50.220 --> 00:00:52.260
- Or perhaps the first year.
- "Just wait two weeks."

00:00:52.260 --> 00:00:53.490
You're like, "God, they're the kindest.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:54.323
They eat everything.

00:00:54.323 --> 00:00:55.156
They do, they're so nice,"

00:00:55.156 --> 00:00:57.150
and then it's just like (growls).

00:00:57.150 --> 00:00:57.983
- [Hilary] Yeah.
(audience laughs)

00:00:57.983 --> 00:00:58.816
You're like, "What is happening?"

00:00:58.816 --> 00:00:59.649
- Oh yeah, my friend'll be like,

00:00:59.649 --> 00:01:02.460
"My daughter's eating
curry, and green things."

00:01:02.460 --> 00:01:03.293
And you're like-

00:01:03.293 --> 00:01:05.043
- Enjoy it. (laughs)
- Mm-hmm, right, just wait.

00:01:05.043 --> 00:01:05.876
- [Kelly] Just wait.

00:01:05.876 --> 00:01:06.750
- Soon it's gonna be like wiped off the-

00:01:06.750 --> 00:01:08.010
- [Kelly] Yeah, "I hate this."

00:01:08.010 --> 00:01:09.363
- Yeah.
- It's so weird.

